    "display_name": "AI In Grocery Stores",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/e7f9a23e083228a1f419d20d1ec32e37-supermaket.png",
    "starter_assets": {
      "The Rise of AI in Grocery Stores Is a Warning, Not a Win.pdf": "f16186f4-aab3-45c4-a8b7-a53276817564.pdf",
      "The Grocery Store of the Future Is Already Here.pdf": "f27159e2-6f06-4665-b479-e8ff057ad5bb.pdf",
      "ROBOT CARTS! FACE PAYMENTS! Grocery Shopping Just Got Totally BONKERS!.pdf": "70bc377b-0dd5-487d-b1b0-ca2533a19d46.pdf"
    },
    "long_instructions": "##AI in My Community: Helpful or Harmful?\r\n###AI in Grocery Stores\r\nClick **Add** > **From Library**. Select and attach the article(s) that you wish the chatbot to engage with.\r\n\r\n###Instructions\r\nConsider using the AI Chat to do one or more of the following:\r\n* Get details from the articles. _Who does this AI help? Who does it hurt?_\r\n* Fact-Check the articles. _What is real and what is exaggerated?_\r\n* Summarize from the viewpoint of a specific community member.\r\n* Ask whose perspective is missing.\r\n\r\n",
